@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000

### List Open Alerts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/alerts?status=OPEN&limit=20
Accept: application/json

### Acknowledge Alert (Idempotent)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/alerts/aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa/acknowledge
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "acknowledged_by": "operator.alpha"
}
